3914
03:13:42,480 --> 03:13:43,200
What is this?

3915
03:13:43,320 --> 03:13:44,440
What is happening here?

3916
03:13:45,300 --> 03:13:46,180
Yeah, that's horrible!

3917
03:13:48,820 --> 03:13:49,260
No.

3918
03:13:52,380 --> 03:13:52,820
No.

3919
03:13:55,120 --> 03:13:55,560
Sir.

3920
