3935
03:14:40,040 --> 03:14:41,840
Gary and Henry's happy home.

3936
03:14:44,340 --> 03:14:44,660
Name.

3937
03:14:46,660 --> 03:14:47,300
Name?

3938
03:14:49,640 --> 03:14:52,120
Oh my god, what a cool ass place.

3939
03:14:54,760 --> 03:14:55,320
Live.

3940
03:14:55,500 --> 03:14:55,580
Live.

3941
03:14:55,580 --> 03:14:55,780
Laugh.

3942
03:14:56,020 --> 03:14:56,280
Hmm.

3943
03:14:57,100 --> 03:14:58,100
Ha ha ha ha ha!

3944
03:15:00,280 --> 03:15:00,640
Nice.

3945
03:15:01,560 --> 03:15:02,760
Henry's Danish Cow.

3946
