That was Bop Billy.

3956
03:15:30,080 --> 03:15:33,100
What about the big house with the glass panel on the side?

3957
03:15:33,180 --> 03:15:33,920
That was really cool.

3958
03:15:35,600 --> 03:15:36,620
I want to go in there.

3959
