3970
03:16:15,230 --> 03:16:15,830
What the?

3971
03:16:15,950 --> 03:16:21,550
Is that... Oh, my God.

3972
03:16:21,550 --> 03:16:22,870
They're making clones!

3973
03:16:25,610 --> 03:16:27,010
Beach lookout.

3974
03:16:28,410 --> 03:16:28,930
Factory.

3975
03:16:30,370 --> 03:16:33,730
There's something rotten in the state of this resort.

3976
03:16:38,300 --> 03:16:39,740
There you are, Gustav.

3977
03:16:41,020 --> 03:16:43,700
It's a shame, really, what they've done to the beach.

3978
03:16:44,700 --> 03:16:45,780
Back in the days.

3979
03:16:46,580 --> 03:16:47,680
Back in the days.

3980
03:16:48,220 --> 03:16:50,840
Back in the days, it was just a calm ocean and the chilling pod trees.

3981
03:16:51,700 --> 03:16:53,520
Nowadays, there's nothing relaxing about it.

3982
03:16:54,040 --> 03:16:55,500
Ships coming and going all the time.

3983
03:16:55,860 --> 03:16:57,100
People shouting at the gate.

3984
03:16:57,800 --> 03:17:01,560
