3991
03:17:18,680 --> 03:17:19,940
That new disco is great.

3992
03:17:20,440 --> 03:17:21,600
Yeah, what about the funfair?

3993
03:17:22,340 --> 03:17:25,880
I just wish we could go back to those simpler, less stressful times, you know?

3994
03:17:27,100 --> 03:17:27,920
Oh, is that the disco?

3995
03:17:31,340 --> 03:17:31,820
Wait a minute.

3996
03:17:32,240 --> 03:17:33,380
We're beaming here now!

3997
03:17:37,660 --> 03:17:40,140
This reminds me of a specific game as well, by the way.

3998
03:17:40,580 --> 03:17:41,200
Really neat.

3999
03:17:43,580 --> 03:17:44,460
One-Eyed Land.

4000
03:17:47,280 --> 03:17:48,440
