4012
03:18:11,800 --> 03:18:13,340
Those must be of great quality.

4013
03:18:14,380 --> 03:18:16,800
They look almost exactly like real villagers.

4014
03:18:18,820 --> 03:18:20,480
I wonder what they're used for.

4015
