You see their legs, right?

4016
03:18:22,900 --> 03:18:23,320
They're moving.

4017
03:18:23,600 --> 03:18:23,920
Agnes.

4018
03:18:24,220 --> 03:18:25,420
Those are real people.

4019
03:18:27,980 --> 03:18:29,020
That's no joke.

4020
03:18:29,380 --> 03:18:29,940
Agnes.

4021
03:18:31,180 --> 03:18:33,500
I wonder what's going on inside this factory.

4022
03:18:35,900 --> 03:18:37,160
Mother of God.

4023
03:18:40,270 --> 03:18:41,790
I shall find out.

4024
03:18:44,030 --> 03:18:45,410
I will be the one.

4025
03:18:48,670 --> 03:18:50,450
There are back entrants I can utilize.

4026
03:18:57,390 --> 03:18:58,230
Oh my God.

4027
03:18:58,230 --> 03:18:59,870
It's super complicated and shit.

4028
03:19:06,220 --> 03:19:07,380
What the hell?

4029
03:19:09,880 --> 03:19:11,320
Are they polluting as well?

4030
03:19:12,680 --> 03:19:13,380
Hold on.

4031
03:19:18,960 --> 03:19:19,840
What did I do?

4032
03:19:23,060 --> 03:19:24,100
Holy shit.

4033
03:19:27,110 --> 03:19:28,330
That looks insane.

4034
03:19:35,620 --> 03:19:36,860
Oh, we can't go to the water.

4035
03:19:37,680 --> 03:19:38,180
Get out.

4036
03:19:38,280 --> 03:19:38,400
Get out.

4037
03:19:38,500 --> 03:19:38,660
Get out.

4038
03:19:41,660 --> 03:19:42,340
Oh, we're fine.

4039
03:19:42,440 --> 03:19:42,580
Okay.

4040
03:19:43,100 --> 03:19:43,380
Ooh.

4041
03:19:44,380 --> 03:19:44,660
Oh!

4042
03:19:47,040 --> 03:19:47,960
Are we okay?

4043
03:19:49,360 --> 03:19:51,160
The darkness came for me again there.

4044
03:19:51,660 --> 03:19:52,680
It was like, wait a minute, wait a minute.

4045
03:19:53,420 --> 03:19:54,320
We weren't done with you.

4046
03:19:55,340 --> 03:19:56,260
Now they're done with me.

4047
03:19:57,840 --> 03:19:59,380
Alright, let's try the front entrance then.

4048
03:20:01,480 --> 03:20:02,520
That has to work, right?

4049
03:20:07,560 --> 03:20:07,920
Agnes!

4050
03:20:09,200 --> 03:20:09,560
Oh!

4051
03:20:10,420 --> 03:20:11,380
Connection lost!

4052
03:20:13,340 --> 03:20:14,360
Oh no.

4053
03:20:16,160 --> 03:20:17,340
Oh no.

4054
03:20:21,140 --> 03:20:22,900
Hopefully my progress was saved.

4055
03:20:27,890 --> 03:20:28,970
Let me try again.

4056
03:20:33,650 --> 03:20:37,270
I think me hitting the switch did something to the server.

4057
03:20:44,430 --> 03:20:45,110
Aha!

4058
03:20:46,030 --> 03:20:47,130
I'm back here.

4059
03:20:47,750 --> 03:20:48,730
Very nice.

4060
03:20:50,410 --> 03:20:51,670
Okay, now let's go this way.

4061
03:20:55,160 --> 03:20:56,200
All around again.

4062
03:20:56,500 --> 03:20:57,220
Back to here.

4063
03:21:00,080 --> 03:21:01,540
I wonder what's happening here.

4064
03:21:01,700 --> 03:21:03,760
So the message is being sent from there to here.

4065
03:21:04,920 --> 03:21:06,640
If I can, uh...

4066
03:21:06,640 --> 03:21:07,500
Disconnect this.

4067
03:21:07,720 --> 03:21:08,340
Maybe that's good.

4068
03:21:10,320 --> 03:21:11,220
Alright, Agnes.

4069
03:21:11,440 --> 03:21:11,960
Hold my beer.

4070
03:21:12,500 --> 03:21:13,300
I'm going in.

4071
03:21:13,560 --> 03:21:14,460
Hold on, let me have a last wig.

4072
03:21:19,070 --> 03:21:19,870
Let's do this.

4073
03:21:23,270 --> 03:21:25,010
That is so cool, the way that works.

4074
03:21:29,560 --> 03:21:31,100
I'll be pressing all the buttons.

4075
03:21:33,320 --> 03:21:34,320
What is this even?

4076
03:21:38,040 --> 03:21:39,340
Oh, it's a crane!

4077
03:21:41,820 --> 03:21:42,380
Neat!

4078
03:21:45,320 --> 03:21:46,440
