4086
03:22:14,520 --> 03:22:15,520
Like, what is this?

4087
03:22:16,560 --> 03:22:17,740
Oh, it's just a sign?

4088
03:22:20,020 --> 03:22:20,500
Hmm.

4089
03:22:22,240 --> 03:22:23,720
I guess I could get on the mountain.

4090
03:22:25,040 --> 03:22:26,180
And jump down on it.

4091
03:22:30,510 --> 03:22:31,510
Anyway, uh...

4092
03:22:31,510 --> 03:22:32,270
Let's go back over here.

4093
03:22:32,650 --> 03:22:33,830
I wanted to go to this place.

4094
03:22:36,750 --> 03:22:37,710
Gustav mentioned it!

4095
03:22:39,730 --> 03:22:41,590
And this is also where we're gonna find a llama.

4096
03:22:44,430 --> 03:22:46,150
But the entrance should probably be in the front.

4097
03:22:47,070 --> 03:22:48,710
I don't know why I'm snooping around the back.

4098
03:22:48,790 --> 03:22:49,250
What is this?

4099
03:22:52,640 --> 03:22:54,700
Oh, it's like a pipe system.

4100
03:22:55,880 --> 03:22:57,460
What are they piping into?

4101
03:22:57,880 --> 03:22:58,620
The disco.

4102
03:23:00,200 --> 03:23:02,760
And is it related to the outhouse?

4103
03:23:04,420 --> 03:23:06,020
Or the hotbox?

4104
03:23:07,400 --> 03:23:08,900
Who's your supplier?

4105
03:23:12,100 --> 03:23:12,560
Guys!

4106
03:23:13,040 --> 03:23:14,020
Where's the entrance?

4107
03:23:14,820 --> 03:23:15,660
Disco!

4108
03:23:17,000 --> 03:23:19,080
Looks like I found it.

4109
03:23:19,640 --> 03:23:21,120
Bjorn the Block Jansen.

4110
