Hold up there, Shrimp.

4111
03:23:24,980 --> 03:23:26,820
Let me take a look at you real quick.

4112
03:23:29,240 --> 03:23:30,840
This club is only for villagers.

4113
03:23:32,280 --> 03:23:34,700
Now, I ain't no villagologist.

4114
03:23:35,000 --> 03:23:35,880
Or anything like that.

4115
03:23:36,000 --> 03:23:39,480
But judging by the size of that nose of yours, I can tell you ain't one.

4116
03:23:40,740 --> 03:23:42,200
So beat it, Shrimp.

4117
03:23:43,100 --> 03:23:43,540
Wow.

4118
03:23:45,640 --> 03:23:46,080
Unbelievable.

4119
03:23:52,330 --> 03:23:53,570
Big nose, no hair.

4120
03:23:54,110 --> 03:23:55,110
Yep, that's a villager.

4121
03:23:56,650 --> 03:23:58,550
Acquire the help of DJ Hoofstep.

4122
03:23:59,350 --> 03:24:00,530
Yeah, I gotta get in, though.

4123
03:24:01,990 --> 03:24:02,670
Ahem, sir.

4124
03:24:03,950 --> 03:24:05,870
No nose, no entry, Shrimp.

4125
03:24:07,010 --> 03:24:07,490
Damn.

4126
03:24:08,450 --> 03:24:09,370
How about I steal your nose?

4127
03:24:10,110 --> 03:24:11,070
There, I got your nose, see?

4128
03:24:25,050 --> 03:24:25,530
Sweet.

4129
03:24:28,630 --> 03:24:30,050
I gotta go find a nose.

4130
03:24:33,100 --> 03:24:34,400
Whose nose can I steal?

4131
03:24:36,060 --> 03:24:36,540
Fuck.

4132
03:24:39,450 --> 03:24:42,150
Hmm, maybe I can buy a nose for my money.

4133
03:24:42,410 --> 03:24:43,750
No, wait, I spent my money already.

4134
03:24:45,830 --> 03:24:47,290
