4145
03:25:35,890 --> 03:25:39,090
Diorite Springs Police Chief Academic Badge Self-Portrait.

4146
03:25:41,350 --> 03:25:42,650
Can I steal the nose?

4147
03:25:53,680 --> 03:25:54,460
What's that?

4148
03:25:56,140 --> 03:25:57,400
Is that a middle finger?

4149
03:26:05,010 --> 03:26:06,970
Can't let villagers into the club.

4150
03:26:07,170 --> 03:26:07,910
Can't get fired.

4151
03:26:09,570 --> 03:26:11,170
Yeah, I know.

4152
03:26:16,560 --> 03:26:18,100
Checking your cupboards here.

4153
03:26:25,430 --> 03:26:27,010
I will sleep in their bed.

4154
03:26:36,600 --> 03:26:38,020
I need a costume.

4155
03:26:46,240 --> 03:26:47,680
I love Outlama.

4156
03:26:48,440 --> 03:26:49,300
What's this?

4157
03:26:52,630 --> 03:26:53,710
Woodcutter's house.

4158
03:26:54,410 --> 03:26:55,490
Or chopper.

4159
03:26:57,710 --> 03:26:59,750
Ron and Rosenfeld's bedroom.

4160
03:27:03,200 --> 03:27:05,440
Yo, look at this nice connection here.

4161
03:27:07,540 --> 03:27:08,260
Casper's bedroom.

4162
03:27:08,400 --> 03:27:09,080
Oh yeah, I was here.

4163
03:27:10,480 --> 03:27:13,120
I hope the llama and inner comms won't come for me.

4164
03:27:15,720 --> 03:27:16,200
Well?

4165
03:27:18,540 --> 03:27:21,280
Who can you fool with stealing a nose?

4166
03:27:21,760 --> 03:27:22,700
The kids, right?

